# Picker mode: another program asks the user to choose a file here (`--pick open|save
# --reply-pipe <name>`), and gets one line back - the path - or nothing, which means they backed
# out. The tab is an ordinary tab with a strip across the top.
#
# `pick` hands the app that command line through the same parser and request path a second launch
# uses. The reply pipe is the run's recorder: nothing here reaches another process.

tree .
media-fixture Media
refresh
assert-tabs 1

# --- an open: a new tab at the folder asked for, with the question across the top ---

pick open Media filter=*.mp4;*.mkv title=Add-a-video
assert-tabs 2
assert-path Media
assert-visible PickBanner
assert-hidden PickName
assert-reply waiting
shot 01-pick-open

# Nothing selected is nothing to choose, and the button says so rather than answering with a folder.
press PickCancel
assert-reply cancelled
assert-tabs 1

# --- the wrong kind of file is refused, and never launched ---

pick open Media filter=*.mp4;*.mkv
select tone.wav
run file.open
assert-reply waiting
assert-not-launched
assert-status not the kind of file asked for

# --- the right kind answers, and the tab that was opened for the question goes with it ---

select clip.mp4
press PickAnswer
assert-reply Media\clip.mp4
assert-tabs 1
assert-not-launched

# --- Enter (or a double-click) on a file is the same answer ---

pick open Media
select tone.flac
run file.open
assert-reply Media\tone.flac
assert-tabs 1
assert-not-launched

# --- a save: beside the file it was started from, with the name on offer in the box ---

pick save Media\clip.mp4 name=clip-edit.mp4 filter=*.mp4;*.gif title=Save-as
assert-tabs 2
assert-path Media
assert-visible PickName
shot 02-pick-save
press PickAnswer
assert-reply Media\clip-edit.mp4
assert-tabs 1

# A typed name with no extension takes the first one the asker offered; nothing is written either way.
pick save Media name=clip-edit.mp4 filter=*.mp4;*.gif
field-type PickName holiday
press PickAnswer
assert-reply Media\holiday.mp4
assert-missing Media\holiday.mp4

# A name that is a path is not a name.
pick save Media name=clip-edit.mp4
field-type PickName ..\elsewhere.mp4
press PickAnswer
assert-reply waiting
assert-status Type a file name
press PickCancel
assert-reply cancelled

# --- closing the tab is backing out ---

pick open Media
assert-tabs 2
closetab
assert-reply cancelled
assert-tabs 1

# --- the asker going away withdraws the question and leaves an ordinary tab ---

pick open Media
assert-visible PickBanner
pose-asker-gone
assert-hidden PickBanner
assert-tabs 2
assert-status stopped waiting
closetab

# --- a pick tab is not part of the session ---

pick open Media
assert-tabs 2
session
assert-tabs 1
